  "migration_notes": "Orders v2 changes how an order's money, customer and payment state are represented. The REST payload, the gRPC OrderSummary message and the orders table all change in the same release (PR 'Orders API v2'). Float money caused rounding incidents, so money must be integer minor units plus an ISO 4217 currency. Clearer payment state renames PENDING to AWAITING_PAYMENT, which consumers must handle. Consumers ship tolerant readers that accept v1 and v2 at the same time during rollout, before removing v1 code paths in a cleanup PR."
